{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他在意自己是不是特别，却怕追着要回应会搅坏眼前的亲近。对方也没答应过什么，他不想催。\",\n      \"key\": \"不想催\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他把心思放回自己能给的关心，真心盼对方过得好，提醒自己这样做也能让自己高兴。\",\n      \"key\": \"能给的关心\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"text\": \"这想法真让他松了口气，给得更痛快，不怕显得更在乎，也不计较给了多少，自己也觉得满足。\",\n      \"key\": \"给得更痛快\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他一放开去喜欢，反而舍不得这一刻过去，想让它多留一会儿。一想到太急会给对方压力，热情又收了回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"多留一会儿\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他把这阵轻松当成了保证，以为只要不向对方要回应，就能尽情喜欢，也不会失去眼前的亲近。\",\n      \"key\": \"不会失去\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R15\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-1\", \"S04-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分\",\n      \"why\": \"S04-1保留他怕期待变成催促、对方没有承诺的顾虑。S04-4让这份顾虑实际造成热情收回，同时补出他想留住眼前亲近的心理。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R16\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"把普遍的关系原则改成他当下的自我安抚：把心思放回自己能给的关心，真心盼对方过得好，并提醒自己这样做也能让自己高兴。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R17\", \"R18\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-3\", \"S04-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并补足\",\n      \"why\": \"S04-3合并松下来、愿意付出、不怕显得更在乎和不计较给了多少，用具体的满足感替代抽象的“更丰盈”。S04-4接上放开去喜欢后更舍不得这一刻过去的心理，解释B1的迫切、B3的想留住和B4的甜中带酸，也解释想到会给对方压力时为何收回热情。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R19\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他把暂时轻松误当成保证的过度推断，作为S05重新想知道自己是否被放在心上的直接前提，明确这是他当时相信的事，不是客观保证。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6e18958a-87cb-46b0-8ec8-eef12188b433", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T131635593461Z", "elapsed_seconds": 1012.937, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T13:33:28.524559+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "32dc82b03700916920a1c316b2c1e68cd2aa77cb0dc106962c32c11923c9e229", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "too